{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Echo Show 8 feels like a useful next addition because it adds video calling and a larger display alongside my existing Fire TV devices.",
    "The smart plug gives me a concrete new use for Alexa: controlling a lamp alongside my home entertainment setup."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Another HD Fire TV Stick adds little because I already have a 4K stick and a Fire TV television; the gaming bundle also assumes an interest in gaming I have not shown.",
    "Owning a camcorder does not mean I need 16TB of storage, and my home viewing and camera purchases give me no immediate reason to choose sport earbuds or a tablet."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My Fire TV purchases seem to have been taken as a reason to suggest almost any Amazon device, even when its purpose overlaps with what I already own.",
    "My interest in electronics seems to have been stretched into unrelated needs for gaming, portable viewing, sport audio, and very large storage."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "What matters is whether a device adds a useful capability to my existing setup, rather than repeating streaming functions I already have.",
    "I would choose selectively: the larger Echo Show interests me more than the smaller display or voice-only speakers, so several compatible Alexa devices are not several purchases I want now."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my connected-home interests but confuse useful additions with redundant devices and unrelated electronics."
}"}
